<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>EnergyX</title>
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="styles.css">
</head>
<body>
    <header>
        <nav>
            <div class="logo">⚡ EnergyX</div>
            <ul class="nav-links">
                <li><a href="#home">Home</a></li>
                <li><a href="#about">About</a></li>
                <li><a href="#contact">Contact</a></li>
            </ul>
        </nav>
    </header>

    <main>
        <section id="home" class="hero">
            <h1>Welcome to EnergyX</h1>
            <p>Powering the future with innovative energy solutions</p>
            <a href="#about" class="cta-button">Learn More</a>
        </section>

        <section id="about" class="about">
            <h2>About EnergyX</h2>
            <p>We are dedicated to advancing clean energy technology and making sustainable solutions accessible to everyone. Our team works tirelessly to develop cutting-edge solutions that reduce carbon footprint while maximizing efficiency.</p>
        </section>

        <section id="contact" class="contact">
            <h2>Contact Us</h2>
            <p>Get in touch with our team to learn more about our services and how we can help you transition to sustainable energy.</p>
            <form class="contact-form">
                <input type="text" placeholder="Your Name" required>
                <input type="email" placeholder="Your Email" required>
                <textarea placeholder="Your Message" rows="5" required></textarea>
                <button type="submit" class="submit-btn">Send Message</button>
            </form>
        </section>
    </main>

    <footer>
        <p>&copy; 2026 EnergyX. All rights reserved.</p>
    </footer>
</body>
</html>
